  Hypothesis PLC : ltac2:(zQ "60!hu3!lv9!mv7!hs4!nje!ms6@1$5@2$3@2$2@2$1@2$0?2TH+hgg0?2sb@2$1@2$0@2$0?2sb$4+hgg0?2TH@2$3@2$2@2$1@2$0?3CTX+q0?2sb@2$1@2$0@2$0?2sb$4+hgg0?3CTX@2$2@2$1@2$0?3CTX+q0?2TH@2$1@2$0?2TH+hgg0?3CTX").
  Hypothesis PLCD : ltac2:(zQ "a1!hu3!lv9!nkc!hs4!nl3!nla!mv7!nje!muf!ms6&@2$0@1$4?1d@2$2+h0+hggg0@1$9@2$3@2$6@2$1@2$0?2TH+hgg0@1$4?1d@2$1~0?2TH@2$3@2$6@2$1@2$0?2TH+hgg0@1$5?1d@2$1@2$0@1$5?1d@2$2+8+ogg0?2TH@2$3@2$6@2$1@2$0@2$0?2sb$7+hgg0@1$4?1d@2$1~0?2sb@2$3@2$6@2$1@2$0@2$0?2sb$7+hgg0@1$5?1d@2$1@2$0@1$5?1d@2$2+8+ogg0?2sb@2$3@2$6@2$1@2$0?3CTX+q0@1$4?1d@2$1~0?3CTX@2$3@2$6@2$1@2$0?3CTX+q0@1$5?1d@2$1@2$0@1$5?1d@2$2+8+ogg0?3CTX@2$3@3$8?5HCEIL@1$4?1d@2$2+h0+hggg0@3$8?5HCEIL@1$5?1d@2$2+8+ogg0").
